; the tables of PS, parametric stereo, ISO/IEC 14496-3 8.A, as
; lib/media/ps.inc reads them
;
; The 10 Huffman books as those of SBR: the intensity differences in
; frequency and time, fine then default, the coherences, the phase
; differences, inner and overall. Each sub-subband's parameter band, of
; 20 and of 34. Then what ffmpeg's ps_tableinit works out, each by 2^30:
; the mixing matrices A and B, of each of 46 intensities and 8
; coherences, h11 h12 h21 h22; the smoothed phases, re then im; the
; all-pass's fractional delays, of 20 bands and of 34, each band's 3
; links (re im) and its phase; the hybrid filters, each subband's 7 taps
; (re im), of 8, 12, 8 and 4; the real filter of 2.
